-dating-chat-meet/id1406184928?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"17+","averageUserRating":4.59503,"currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-11-13T09:57:45Z","artistId":1406184927,"genres":["Lifestyle","Social Networking"],"artistName":"Smitten ehf.","trackId":1406184928,"trackName":"Smitten Dating: Chat & Meet","primaryGenreName":"Lifestyle","primaryGenreId":6012,"releaseDate":"2019-06-14T17:08:10Z","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"version":"3.7.18","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"First dates that feel like the second.\n\nMeet Smitten, the dating app built to get people talking.\nDating apps ask you to fit your entire personality into a few photos and a bio. Then, when you finally match, they hand you an empty chat box.\nWe believe people deserve more to go on.\nSo their photo caught your eye? Now find out what you'd ask in person.\n\nGET TO KNOW SOMEONE, ONE GAME AT A TIME\nSmitten's interactive games help you discover people's personalities, opinions, and quirks. And when you match, game results land right in your chat, giving you something better to start with than \"hey.\"\nGUESSARY: Guess things about someone you wouldn't have thought to ask. Getting it wrong is half the conversation.\nWAVY: Rate hot takes, guess where they stand, and find out what you agree (or strongly disagree) on.\nLIE DETECTOR: Two truths and a lie. Spot the lie, then ask for the story.\n\nSO YOU HAVE A CRUSH? SEARCH THEIR NAME\nSometimes you don't need to discover someone new. You'd just like to know more about someone you've already noticed. Fair enough.\n\nA LITTLE NUDGE TO MAKE A MOVE\nMatches expire after 10 days without a message, so that \"we should talk\" doesn't sit there forever.\nBecause \"we should meet sometime\" deserves an actual time and place.\n\nUNLOCK SMITTEN PREMIUM\nSee who likes you, undo likes/nopes, send unlimited likes, get read receipts, and go incognito.\n\nSmitten is free to use, with optional Premium features.\n\nYour profile shouldn't feel like a press release.\nYour first chat shouldn't feel like a job interview.\nAnd your first date shouldn't have to start at zero.\n\nSo… you next?\n\nTerms: https://www.websitepolicies.com/policies/view/d4cOtUMF","languageCodesISO2A":["EN"],"fileSizeBytes":"103751680","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1368,"trackContentRating":"17+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.59503,"sellerUrl":"https://smitten.fun","bundleId":"com.theone.theoneapp","genreIds":["6012","6005"],"sellerName":"Smitten ehf.","releaseNotes":"A little polish behind the scenes to keep Smitten running smoothly. Now, back to getting to know someone new","price":0.0,"minimumOsVersion":"16.4","userRatingCount":1368}